    {
      "blockId": "tour:subsection_text:976a850bcb4f257f",
      "field": "subsection.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8dc1ab767eb1ede903fe929fc36d9c710f315c3eff0ed2710df838e6315b0ccb",
      "text": "The day's programme gives the following prices per person: Macuco Safari $135, Bird Park $65 and helicopter flight $170.\n\nThe additional list for the same offer gives different amounts: Macuco Safari $130 per person; Bird Park $55 per person; and a 10-minute helicopter flight for $250, with a minimum of 3 people. The pricing basis for the latter amount is not specified. Before booking, confirm the applicable rate and flight conditions. Macuco Safari and Bird Park are offered in the list as additions to the Brazilian-side falls tour. A DVD recording of Macuco Safari can be ordered separately.\n\nRafain show at Rafain Grill Place: $95 per person, with drinks charged separately. A buffet of meat dishes, vegetables, fruit and desserts is accompanied by performances by Latin American artists.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw2f04s0-q8r0sp",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The assigned RU subsection reconciles conflicting day/list tariffs and mentions a DVD not present in Word. Word paragraph 223 specifies USD250 per person whereas assigned RU leaves its basis unspecified. Translate the RU subsection without altering any price or pricing basis; commercial reconciliation belongs to the master."
      }
